> Real full photographs and an explicitly SGD-fitted field prior

The pinned official COCO8-Pose archive contains8 original photographs and
human COCO17 annotations. Train IDs36/49/77 fit;86 validates;original validation
IDs110/113/136/151 are held out. Whole images resize to128px with tensor
legacy bilinear RGB preprocessing;no person crop or box enters prediction.
Fitting-only anatomical mirrors produce6 fitting rows,validation1,test4.
The test set has14 annotated people and116 labeled non-neck joints.
The same source photograph never crosses splits. Boxes are used only for
missing-label masks and the declared evaluation rule.

```{cpp, flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
  const std::filesystem::path cache = dm::datasets::data_home();
  dm::datasets::prepare_example_data("pose", (cache / "human_pose").string());
}
```
